    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HISTORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Count Dracula inherits the legendary Dark Dreams Hotel, a once-glorious resort, he expects a grand legacy - but instead finds himself in a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/360397706fbf64821f41e2a9f67bfeab.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Dracula prepares to restore the hotel to its former grandeur, he discovers that rival hotel owners\u2014witches, werewolves, and magicians\u2014are plotting against him. With his rivals getting up to no good, it\u2019s up to you to help Dracula revive the hotel, outsmart the competition, and uncover hidden secrets lurking in the shadows. Gather resources, recruit legendary experts, and ensure the resort is ready for the grand reopening. But beware of the Ministry of Control and Prohibition, which has its own list of impossible demands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/0ad44435d215a763e8219a04c6b1fff6.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore the Dark Dreams Hotel to its former glory? Or will Dracula\u2019s inheritance become his greatest nightmare? Help Dracula out in Incredible Dracula 12: License to Relax!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/85e8561598eb268e52f2fe19163f8361.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible Dracula: License to Relax, as in any time manager you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources and timely use of bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a large variety of buildings and unique items, collecting them you will perform tasks and participate in unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/ae6ceb14ebc29dc5dff0b748ebb6c532.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upsell Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 levels to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step level guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful desktop wallpapers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the \u201cCursed Treasure\u201d section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the Dark Dreams section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HISTORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Count Dracula inherits the legendary Dark Dreams Hotel, a once-glorious resort, he expects a grand legacy - but instead finds himself in a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/360397706fbf64821f41e2a9f67bfeab.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Dracula prepares to restore the hotel to its former grandeur, he discovers that rival hotel owners\u2014witches, werewolves, and magicians\u2014are plotting against him. With his rivals getting up to no good, it\u2019s up to you to help Dracula revive the hotel, outsmart the competition, and uncover hidden secrets lurking in the shadows. Gather resources, recruit legendary experts, and ensure the resort is ready for the grand reopening. But beware of the Ministry of Control and Prohibition, which has its own list of impossible demands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/0ad44435d215a763e8219a04c6b1fff6.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore the Dark Dreams Hotel to its former glory? Or will Dracula\u2019s inheritance become his greatest nightmare? Help Dracula out in Incredible Dracula 12: License to Relax!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/85e8561598eb268e52f2fe19163f8361.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible Dracula: License to Relax, as in any time manager you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources and timely use of bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a large variety of buildings and unique items, collecting them you will perform tasks and participate in unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/ae6ceb14ebc29dc5dff0b748ebb6c532.avif?t=1749628166\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upsell Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 levels to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step level guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful desktop wallpapers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the \u201cCursed Treasure\u201d section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the Dark Dreams section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
